    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly positioned in the heart of Smithfield, this outstanding two-bedroom penthouse combines generous proportions, excellent natural light and secure parking.\n\nSavills are delighted to present this exceptional two-bedroom penthouse apartment in the Old Distillery development, ideally positioned in the heart of Smithfield.\n\nOccupying a superb penthouse setting, this bright and spacious residence is enhanced by its impressive high ceilings, which create a bright and airy atmosphere throughout the apartment. The well-proportioned interior extends to a welcoming entrance hall, an open-plan kitchen/living and dining area, two generous double bedrooms, and a stylish family bathroom. There is excellent storage throughout the apartment.\n\nThe apartment is further enhanced by a secure designated car parking space, a highly valuable amenity in this vibrant city-centre location.\n\nThe Old Distillery is a mature and well-maintained development situated in one of Dublin's most dynamic neighbourhoods. Residents benefit from immediate access to an excellent range of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and cultural amenities in Smithfield and the surrounding areas. The LUAS Red Line is within a short stroll, providing convenient access throughout the city, while the city centre, Phoenix Park and TU Dublin Grangegorman campus are all easily accessible.\n\nThis turnkey penthouse apartment will appeal to a broad range of purchasers, including owner-occupiers, investors and those seeking a stylish city home in a prime Dublin location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
