        "Content": "<ul><li>Penthouse apartment</li><li>Two spacious double bedrooms</li><li>High ceilings throughout</li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation</li><li>Secure designated car parking space</li><li>Excellent transport links via LUAS</li><li>Walking distance to Dublin City Centre</li><li>Attractive owner-occupier and investment opportunity</ul>"
